message: "If you use these data, please cite them using the metadata below."
title: "Climate Knowledge Graph Core Data for AR6"
type: dataset
version: "[1.0.0]"
date-released: "[YYYY-MM-DD]"
repository-code: "https://github.com/[owner]/CKG-Data"
url: "https://github.com/[owner]/CKG-Data"
license: CC0-1.0
license-url: "https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode"
keywords:
  - climate change
  - IPCC AR6
  - knowledge graph
  - linked open data
  - ontology
abstract: >-
  Master copies of datasets (acronyms, authors, bibliographic records,
  corpus, glossary) from the Climate Knowledge Graph, with the ER model
  describing how they connect as Linked Open Data. Data are derived from
  the IPCC Sixth Assessment Report (AR6).
references:
  - type: report
    title: "Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, Climate Change 2022: Impacts, Adaptation and Vulnerability, Climate Change 2022: Mitigation of Climate Change (IPCC AR6)"
    authors:
      - name: "Intergovernmental Panel on Climate Change (IPCC)"
    url: "https://www.ipcc.ch/assessment-report/ar6/"
    year: 2023
